# recipe whose _pins has a sha256 that this file does not list, and
# scripts/build.sh runs it before abuild, so CI never builds (or publishes) boot
# control that the rules do not name. Add a line only after the owner entered
# the sha in RULES.md, with the RULES entry. One line: SHA256 PATH # entry.
# scripts/check-rules-content.sh checks every BUILT .apk by its content as well
# (the guarded paths, whatever the recipe declares) and the Linux Image of a
